    "title": "FedEx to close Cheektowaga distribution center this summer - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago CHEEKTOWAGA, N.Y. — FedEx recently announced that it will close its Cheektowaga shipping and distribution center this summer. In a statement, the company told 2 On Your Side that the Cayuga Road facility will shutter this August, as part of a larger \"network transformation strategy.\" Several other facilities across the state will close as well. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
